#: data/script/fcitx-diagnose.sh:689
msgid ""
"If you are using ${1}, you may want to uninstall ${2}, remove ${3} or use "
"the command ${g36_disable_ibus} to disable IBus integration in order to use "
"any input method other than ${2}. See ${link} for more detail."
msgstr ""
"As jy is gebruik ${1}, wil jy dalk om te ont installeer ${2}, verwyder ${3} "
"of gebruik die bevel ${g36_disable_ibus} om IBus-integrasie uit te skakel en "
"orde om gebruik enige invoer metode anders as ${2}. Sien ${skakel} vir meer "
"besonderhede."

